      "summary": "The world's largest operational submarine, a Russian special-purpose boat carrying Poseidon nuclear drones. Key figures: displacement 17,000 tons, length 184 m, top speed 15 knots, crew 110, built 1. In service with 1 navy — Russia (1).",
      "origin_text": "🇷🇺 Russia",
