      "ship_name": "France Libre-class (PANG)",
      "summary": "France's planned 80,000-ton nuclear carrier with EMALS catapults, replacing the Charles de Gaulle around 2038. Key figures: displacement 80,000 tons, length 310 m, top speed 27 knots, crew 2,000, built 1. No longer in service; operated by 1 navy over its career.",
