      "summary": "South Korean patrol vessel, introduced in 2008, reaches speeds of 44.0 knots using CODAG propulsion. Key figures: displacement 570 tons, length 63 m, top speed 44 knots, crew 40, unit cost $37M, built 34. In service with 1 navy — South Korea (18).",
