      "ship_name": "Kalvari-class (Project 75)",
      "summary": "The Kalvari class is a series of diesel-electric attack submarines built for the Indian Navy under license from France, based on the Scorpène design; lead boat commissioned 2017. Key figures: displacement 1,615 tons, length 68 m, top speed 11 knots, crew 43, built 6. In service with 1 navy — India (6).",
