      "summary": "Russia's Khabarovsk-class submarine, scheduled for commissioning in 2025, is a nuclear-powered strategic vessel distinguished by its design as a dedicated carrier for Poseidon nuclear-armed drones. Key figures: displacement 10,000 tons, built 1. Not yet in service; on order for 1 navy — Russia.",
