      "summary": "American amphibious landing craft, introduced in 1986, achieves 70 knots using four gas turbine engines. Key figures: displacement 185 tons, length 27 m, top speed 70 knots, crew 5, unit cost $24M, built 97. No longer in service; operated by 2 navies over its career.",
