      "summary": "Commissioned by Russia in 2003, the Losharik-class submarine is designed for deep-sea research and special operations, featuring an inner hull made of interconnected titanium spheres. Key figures: displacement 1,600 tons, crew 25, built 1. In service with 1 navy — Russia (1).",
      "commissioned": "by Russia in 2003, the Losharik-class submarine is designed for deep-sea research and special operations, featuring an inner hull made of interconnected titanium spheres.",
