      "summary": "Introduced by Ukraine in 2023, the MAGURA V5 is a reconnaissance and strike unmanned surface vehicle featuring a low-profile V-shaped hull designed for reduced radar visibility. Key figures: displacement 1 tons, length 5.5 m, top speed 42 knots. No longer in service; operated by 3 navies over its career.",
