      "summary": "Australian-built patrol boat supplied to twelve Pacific island states from 1987, displacing 162 tonnes. Key figures: displacement 162 tons, length 32 m, top speed 20 knots, crew 16, unit cost $8M, built 22. No longer in service; operated by 11 navies over its career.",
