      "summary": "The Riachuelo-class is a Brazilian Navy diesel-electric attack submarine, commissioned starting in 2022, derived from France's Scorpène design. Key figures: displacement 1,900 tons, length 71 m, crew 32, unit cost $1B, built 3. In service with 1 navy — Brazil (3).",
