      "page_title": "Rihtniemi-class Patrol vessel: Full Specs & Armament",
      "meta_description": "Rihtniemi-class patrol vessel specs: displacement, dimensions, armament, propulsion and speed. Finnish naval vessel commissioned in 1957 — full specifications, history and operators.",
