      "ship_name": "Rihtniemi-class",
      "summary": "Finnish patrol boat Rihtniemi, introduced in 1957, has a displacement of 110 tons and a crew of 20. Key figures: displacement 110 tons, length 31 m, top speed 15 knots, crew 20. No longer in service; operated by 1 navy over its career.",
      "origin_text": "🇫🇮 Finland",
