      "ship_name": "Sarov-class (B-90)",
      "summary": "Commissioned by Russia in 2008, the Sarov-class submarine serves as an experimental weapons-testing platform, featuring a hybrid propulsion system that combines diesel-electric and auxiliary nuclear power. Key figures: displacement 2,300 tons, length 98 m, top speed 10 knots, crew 52, built 1. In service with 1 navy — Russia (1).",
      "commissioned": "by Russia in 2008, the Sarov-class submarine serves as an experimental weapons-testing platform, featuring a hybrid propulsion system that combines diesel-electric and auxiliary nuclear power.",
