      "summary": "United States Expeditionary Fast Transport, 1,515 tons displacement, has a maximum speed of 43 knots. Key figures: displacement 1,515 tons, length 103 m, top speed 43 knots, crew 41, unit cost $180M, built 15. In service with 1 navy — United States (11).",
