      "ship_name": "Stirling Castle-class",
      "summary": "The UK Royal Navy commissioned HMS Stirling Castle (M01) in July 2025 as a mine countermeasures mothership, converted from the commercial offshore support vessel Island Crown. Key figures: displacement 6,000 tons, length 97 m, crew 100, unit cost $49M, built 1. In service with 1 navy — United Kingdom (1).",
      "origin_text": "🇬🇧 United Kingdom",
