      "summary": "Commissioned by China in 2012, the Type 032 is an auxiliary submarine serving as a weapons testbed, characterized by a large sail housing vertical missile launch tubes. Key figures: displacement 3,797 tons, length 93 m, built 1. In service with 1 navy — China (1).",
      "commissioned": "by China in 2012, the Type 032 is an auxiliary submarine serving as a weapons testbed, characterized by a large sail housing vertical missile launch tubes.",
