      "summary": "Built by Hudong Shipyard, nine Chinese Type 053H1 frigates, an improved Type 053H with SJD-5 sonar and six SY-2 anti-ship missiles in two triple launchers, commissioned between 1982 and 1988. Key figures: displacement 1,702 tons, length 103 m, top speed 26 knots, crew 190, built 9. In service with 1 navy — Myanmar (2).",
