      "ship_name": "Type 076-class (Yulan)",
      "summary": "Chinese 50,000-ton amphibious assault ship, the world's first drone carrier with an electromagnetic catapult. Key figures: displacement 50,000 tons, length 260 m, built 1. Not yet in service; on order for 1 navy — China.",
      "origin_text": "🇨🇳 China",
