      "description": "TCG Ufuk (A-591) is a signals intelligence gathering vessel operated by the Turkish Navy. Built as part of the MILGEM project, the vessel's construction began in February 2019, and the ship was commissioned in January 2022.\n\nThe vessel utilizes an Ada -class corvette hull and is configured for electronic intelligence gathering. It assumed the intelligence collection role previously performed by smaller intelligence boats in the Turkish Navy.\n\nFollowing its commissioning, Ufuk entered active service. In April 2022, the vessel undertook its first operational deployment and participated in the Mavi Vatan-2022 naval exercise.",
