      "summary": "A Damen-designed corvette in Pakistan Navy service since 2020, delivered in two batches: the 2,300-tonne OPV 1900 and the larger, more heavily armed 2,600-tonne OPV 2600 (from 2024). Key figures: displacement 2,300 tons, length 91 m, top speed 22 knots, crew 60, built 4. In service with 1 navy — Pakistan (4).",
