      "summary": "The Yukan-class is a Chinese navy amphibious landing ship designed to transport troops, featuring bow doors and stern gates for rapid roll-on/roll-off vehicle deployment. Key figures: displacement 4,237 tons, length 120 m, top speed 18 knots, built 7. No longer in service; operated by 1 navy over its career.",
