      "ship_name": "Yushan-class",
      "summary": "Commissioned by Taiwan in 2022, the indigenously built Yushan-class amphibious transport dock deploys troops and equipment and features integrated anti-ship and air-defense missile systems. Key figures: displacement 10,600 tons, length 153 m, top speed 22 knots, crew 190, built 1. In service with 1 navy — Taiwan (1).",
